    <briefdescription>
<para>A tick label formatter that displays tick values as formatted date/time strings. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tick values are interpreted as milliseconds since the Unix epoch (1970-01-01T00:00:00 UTC).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1NumericTickLabelFormatter" kindref="compound">NumericTickLabelFormatter</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1TickLabelFormatter" kindref="compound">TickLabelFormatter</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
